{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07717","headline":"采樵作 · 孟浩然","name":"采樵作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采樵入深山，山深树重叠。\n桥崩卧槎拥，路险垂藤接。\n日落伴将稀，山风拂萝衣。\n长歌负轻策，平野望烟归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}